MODIFICATIONS

This distribution contains a MODIFIED version of the original LabelBricks application.
The LICENSE requires that modified files carry prominent notices stating they were
changed; this notice records those changes collectively.

Modified relative to the original:
  * app.py — annotations persist as JSON sidecars on a Unity Catalog Volume; the
    Lakebase/PostgreSQL storage layer and its endpoints were removed, and
    /api/image-statuses was reimplemented over those sidecars.
  * libraries/ — reduced to ai_client.py (Foundation Model API vision client).
    db.py, schema.py, storage.py, migration.py and volumes.py were removed.
  * static/js/ — label autocomplete now uses browser localStorage only;
    the JSON-to-database migration call was removed.
  * app.yaml, requirements.in/txt, pyproject.toml — dropped the psycopg dependency
    and the database environment configuration.
  * README.md — rewritten to describe the above.

The app is deployed by the Databricks Asset Bundle at the root of this repository,
which adds an ingest / annotate / export-COCO / train / serve pipeline around it.

